      "help_en": "How you obtain this ID depends on the value of `scenario`.\n\nWhen the `scenario` input parameter is `SYNC`:\n\nFrom the `Get Article List` response, use the top-level `articleId` field.\n\nFrom the `Get Article Details` response, use the top-level `articleId` field.\n\nWhen the `scenario` input parameter is `EXPAND`:\n\nFrom the `Get Article Details` response, use the `sceneid` field from an element in the `sceneList` array",
